-## API Reference
-
-`Scene` is the primary entry point: it owns a `RootNode` (`Node`) hierarchy, and its static
-`FromFile()`/`FromStream()` and instance `Save()` methods perform format-aware loading and
-saving via the `FileFormat` registry.
-
